  "Question": "The product of string length $L$ and frequency $f$ is constant. What type of relationship exists between $f$ and $L$? ( )",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Direct proportion",
    "B": "Inverse proportion",
    "C": "Linear function (not a direct proportion)",
    "D": "Quadratic function"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "$L\\times f=k$ (a constant) can be written as $f=k/L$, which is an inverse proportion.",
